/**
 * Renderer-owned translations: UI chrome (tabs, headers, buttons, status
 * messages) plus the key-based lookups for category/severity/action labels.
 * Using keys (not the backend's pre-rendered `label` strings) for those
 * lookups means switching language re-renders them instantly, without
 * re-running a scan. Free-text finding titles/details are generated by the
 * main process in whichever locale was active *at scan time* — see
 * src/i18n.js — so those only pick up a language change on the next scan.
 */

